#: ../../usage/submit_isrcs.rst:4
msgid ":index:`Submitting ISRCs <ISRC; submitting>`"
msgstr ":index:`提交 ISRCs <ISRC; submitting>`"

#: ../../usage/submit_isrcs.rst:6
msgid "ISRCs are very useful for identifying tracks and recordings, so it is valuable to add them when you are tagging files. Picard can be used to submit ISRCs to the MusicBrainz database."
msgstr ""
"ISRCs 对识别音轨和录音非常有用，因此在你标记文件时添加它们很有价值。Picard 可"
"以用来将 ISRCs 提交给 MusicBrainz 数据库。"

#: ../../usage/submit_isrcs.rst:8
msgid "You can submit ISRCs for tracks that are already in the MusicBrainz database, provided they have ISRCs available in their metadata. If you have a CD with ISRCs, you can enable the \"Read ISRCs from CD\" option in the :doc:`../config/options_cdlookup` to read them from the CD when you do a disc lookup."
msgstr ""
"你可以为已经在 MusicBrainz 数据库中的音轨提交 ISRCs，前提是它们的元数据中包"
"含 ISRCs。如果你有一张带有 ISRCs 的 CD，你可以在 :doc:`../config/"
"options_cdlookup` 中启用 \"从 CD 读取 ISRCs\" 选项，在执行光盘查找时从 CD 中"
"读取它们。"

#: ../../usage/submit_isrcs.rst:10
msgid "To submit ISRCs, select :menuselection:`\"File --> Submit ISRCs\"` or click the \"Submit ISRCs\" button if you have it included in your action toolbar. Picard will check that the ISRCs are valid, that the same ISRC doesn't appear on more than one track on the release, and that the ISRCs are not already present in the database. If all checks pass, the ISRCs will be marked for submission to the MusicBrainz database."
msgstr ""
"要提交 ISRCs，请选择 :menuselection:`\"文件 --> 提交 ISRCs\"`，或者如果你在操"
"作工具栏中包含它，请点击 \"提交 ISRCs\" 按钮。Picard 将检查 ISRCs 是否有效，"
"同一 ISRC 是否不会出现在发行品的多个音轨上，以及 ISRCs 是否已经存在于数据库中"
"。如果所有检查都通过，ISRCs 将被标记为提交到 MusicBrainz 数据库。"

#: ../../usage/submit_isrcs.rst:12
msgid "You will be presented with a list of all tracks and their ISRCs, and can select which tracks will be submitted. Any ISRCs that cannot be submitted due to failing the checkswill be indicated as such, and hovering over them will show the reason why they cannot be submitted. You can cancel the submission if changes are required before submitting."
msgstr ""
"系统将显示所有音轨及其 ISRCs 的列表，你可以选择要提交哪些音轨。由于检查失败而"
"无法提交的任何 ISRCs 都会标明，将鼠标悬停在它们上面将显示无法提交的原因。如果"
"你在提交之前需要更改，可以取消提交。"

#: ../../usage/submit_isrcs.rst:14
msgid "The steps to follow to submit ISRCs are:"
msgstr "提交 ISRCs 的步骤如下："

#: ../../usage/submit_isrcs.rst:16
msgid "Match your files to a release in the right-hand pane."
msgstr "在右侧窗格中将你的文件与正确的发行品匹配。"

#: ../../usage/submit_isrcs.rst:18
msgid "Select :menuselection:`\"File --> Submit ISRCs\"` or click the \"Submit ISRCs\" button if you have it included in your action toolbar."
msgstr ""
"选择 :menuselection:`\"文件 --> 提交 ISRCs\"`，或者如果你在操作工具栏中包含它"
"，请点击 \"提交 ISRCs\" 按钮。"

#: ../../usage/submit_isrcs.rst:20
msgid "Picard will check the ISRCs and present a list of all tracks and their ISRCs. By default, all tracks with new ISRCs that have passed validation will be selected for submission."
msgstr ""
"Picard 将检查 ISRCs 并显示所有音轨及其 ISRCs 的列表。默认情况下，所有通过验证"
"的新 ISRCs 音轨都将被选中以提交。"

#: ../../usage/submit_isrcs.rst:22
msgid "Review the list, deselect any tracks you do not want to submit by clearing the checkbox, and click \"Submit\" to submit the ISRCs to the MusicBrainz database."
msgstr ""
"查看列表，通过清除复选框取消选择你不希望提交的任何音轨，然后点击 \"提交\" 将 "
"ISRCs 提交给 MusicBrainz 数据库。"

#: ../../usage/submit_isrcs.rst:39
msgid "The submission confirmation dialog will show a list of all tracks and their ISRCs for **every** release appearing in the Album pane. The list will show the status of the ISRCs for each track, and you can select which tracks you want to submit. New ISRCs that cannot be submitted because they are invalid or appear on more than one track will not be allowed to be submitted. You can cancel the submission if you want to make changes before submitting."
msgstr ""
"提交确认对话框将显示专辑窗格中所有发行品的**所有**音轨及其 ISRC 列表。列表将"
"显示每个音轨的 ISRC 状态，您可以从中选择要提交的音轨。由于无效或出现在多个音"
"轨上的新 ISRC 无法提交，因此不允许提交。如果您在提交前想进行更改，可以取消提"
"交。"
